    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll try the ginger tea. but honestly it feels pretty heavy sometimes, almost like someone is leaning on my chest when i'm moving around. i've also been feeling a little lightheaded when it happens. is it possible the dizziness is just because of the heartburn, or should i really be worried about my heart?",
      "source": "evaluator"
